  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mousanada 2: Strengthening Institutions and Public Policies for Good Governance in Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Multi-Donor Action &lt;em&gt;Mousanada 2: Strengthening Institutions and Public Policies for Good Governance in Libya &lt;/em&gt;is jointly co-financed by the European Union and the German Federal Ministry for Economic Cooperation and Development (BMZ) and implemented by GIZ within the framework of, and in coordination with, the BMZ programme &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;&#xBF;&lt;/span&gt;Support to Municipalities as a contribution to peace-building in Libya&#xBF; (SML 3)&#xBF;. The duration of this Action is scheduled from 01/01/2025 to 31/12/2027 (36 months) with a total budget of &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;9 million &lt;/span&gt;EUR (EU contribution&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt; 7 million EUR and BMZ contribution 2 million EUR&lt;/span&gt;). BMZ&#xBF;s total funding for the BMZ programme SML 3 is &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;11 million EUR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Action contributes to the EU Action Document for Support to Governance and Stabilisation in Libya (Annex 3 to the Commission Implementing Decision on the financing of the special measure in favour of Libya for 2023). In particular, the Action will contribute to the Specific Objective 1 of the Action Document, i.e., institutions and public policies are enhanced at national and municipal levels. This will be done by providing technical assistance through a second phase of the project&lt;em&gt; Mousanada for Libya - European Union Support to Public Administration,&lt;/em&gt; thereby achieving Output 1.1. of the Action Document, i.e., technical assistance to targeted institutions is provided.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Building on the achievements and lessons learned of the first phase, &lt;em&gt;Mousanada 2 &lt;/em&gt;will focus on reinforcing selected Libyan institutions supported through &lt;em&gt;Mousanada 1&lt;/em&gt; while extending the support to additional national as well as municipal level institutions in all regions of the country and incorporating e-governance modalities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Overall Objective&lt;/strong&gt; of the Action is to contribute to strengthening and promoting democracy and inclusive democratic processes (at the national and local level).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective&lt;/strong&gt; (outcome) of the Action is to strengthen public institutions, inclusive policies, and efficient service delivery at national and municipal levels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To achieve the Specific Objective, the Action will focus on generating two outputs, one at national level and one at municipal level:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1: &lt;/strong&gt;Demand-driven, flexible technical assistance provided to selected national level public institutions, focusing on good governance reforms, institutional support and public policy efficiency and inclusiveness.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2:&lt;/strong&gt; Demand-driven, flexible technical assistance provided to selected municipalities focusing on decentralised local governance, efficient service delivery, and institutional support.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
